{"unit_id":"173787247__dsh-wsl-jev#feature-1","repo":"173787247/dsh-wsl-jev","commit":"92d3e443b8679a375c11f3119705f47c23da37ac","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-wsl-jev 的功能「结构化提问」：针对提供的 state 构造 noul、choice 或 score 问题，并返回回答及置信度等结构化结果。通过 jev_ask 工具触发，输入上下文和问题数组。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:65-97","lib/tools.js:5-22"]}
{"unit_id":"173787247__dsh-wsl-jev#feature-2","repo":"173787247/dsh-wsl-jev","commit":"92d3e443b8679a375c11f3119705f47c23da37ac","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-wsl-jev 的功能「证据核验」：询问一条主张是否由给定证据支持。调用 jev_check 并提交 claim，可选提供 evidence；结果为单个 noul 判断。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:99-126","lib/tools.js:24-38"]}
{"unit_id":"173787247__dsh-wsl-jev#feature-3","repo":"173787247/dsh-wsl-jev","commit":"92d3e443b8679a375c11f3119705f47c23da37ac","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-wsl-jev 的功能「候选排序」：依据 query 将候选项映射为 choice 选项，并把返回的选择键还原为候选文本与置信度。调用 jev_rank，输入查询及 2 到 32 个候选项。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:128-157","lib/tools.js:40-57"]}
{"unit_id":"173787247__dsh-wsl-jev#feature-4","repo":"173787247/dsh-wsl-jev","commit":"92d3e443b8679a375c11f3119705f47c23da37ac","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-wsl-jev 的功能「服务状态」：显示当前 provider、endpoint、模型、代理状态和是否检测到 API key，不展示密钥内容。调用 jev_status 查看。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:42-63","lib/client.js:34-51"]}
